摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A simple popup that can quickly show when Deepseek has finished thinking or is requesting permission during split-screen.","id":"gh:1335601620","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-thinking-notifier","slug":"6-debug-6/dsh-thinking-notifier","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A simple popup that can quickly show when Deepseek has finished thinking or is requesting permission"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" during split-screen."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-thinking-notifier"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin that shows a small **always-on-top desktop popup** in the bottom-rig"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ht corner of your screen. It mirrors the AI's thinking status in real time and alerts you when the A"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"I **requests permission**, **waits for a choice from you**, or **finishes thinking** — even when you"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" are working in other apps, browsers, or virtual desktops."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 中文说明见 README.zh.md"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| State | Popup | Sound |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| AI is thinking | DeepSeek-blue pulsing dot + `AI 正在思考…` + elapsed time. Auto-collapses to a 25 px "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"slim right-edge tab after 5 s; hover or click the tab to expand it again | none |\n| AI waits for you"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"r choice | Violet pulsing dot + `AI 正在等待你的选择` + the question heading, the first question's option la"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"bels (`选项：A / B`, `（可多选）` for multi-select, `（共 N 问）` when several questions arrive at once) and how"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" long it has been waiting. Stays expanded until you answer | system Question |\n| AI requests permiss"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ion | Amber pulsing dot + `AI 请求权限` + session/tool name. Stays expanded until you decide | system Ex"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"clamation |\n| AI finished thinking | Green dot + `AI 已完成思考`, auto-hides after 12 s | system Asterisk"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" |\n| Idle | Hidden | none |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek-style dark card (`#1E2235` / `#4D6BFE`).\n- Always-on-top frameless window, bottom-right, "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"visible over any application.\n- Auto-collapses into a 25 px slim right-edge tab after 5 s while the "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"AI is thinking, so it stays visible without blocking desktop controls.\n- Hover or click the edge tab"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" to expand it manually; new turns, questions, permission requests, and completions expand it automat"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ically.\n- Click the **X** button to dismiss the current popup; the next new turn, question, permissi"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"on request, or completion will show it again.\n- Questions are shown with their options, which is eno"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"ugh to know what is being decided; the answer itself is still given in the DSH Web UI (the popup is "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"read-only by design).\n- Multiple sessions are summarized automatically.\n- The popup process stays al"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"ive while DSH runs; it exits ~15 s after the status endpoint becomes unreachable.\n- No browser exten"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"sion required; the popup is a native desktop window."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Status JSON"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"`GET http://127.0.0.1:7389/status` returns:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`mode` priority: `pending` (an approval is waiting) > `question` (a question is waiting) > `running`"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" > `done` (shown for 12 s) > `idle`.\n`pendingKind` is `approval` or `question`. `timeText` is the th"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"inking timer while `running` and the waiting time while `question`; `detailText` carries the first q"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" `running` and the waiting time while `question`; `detailText` carries the first question's options."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### From a local checkout"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### From npm (once published)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Environment variable | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `DSH_THINKING_NOTIFIER_PORT` | `7389` | Local status server port. If busy, the next 10 ports are t"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ried. |\n| `DSH_THINKING_NOTIFIER_NO_POPUP` | unset | Set to `1` to run the status server without lau"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"nching the desktop popup (headless, tests). |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness Web UI (`dsh web`)\n- Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`\n- Windows: Windows 10/11 with"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" PowerShell 5.1+ (built in)\n- macOS/Linux: Python 3 with `tkinter`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Verification status"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Being explicit about what has actually been tested, so nobody is surprised:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Area | Status |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Thinking / done states, popup geometry, sounds, single instance | verified on Windows 10/11 (Power"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"Shell 5.1 + WPF) |\n| Question state (`ask_user_question`) | verified end to end in a live DSH sessio"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"n (a real question drove the popup into the waiting state, and it cleared when the answer arrived), "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"against the real `ctx.userQuestions` service in a cordis context, and by the smoke test |\n| Permissi"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"on alert (amber) | **verified only with the mock status service.** On a Windows DSH install without "},{"id":"p30s6","text":"a confining sandbox, an out-of-workspace write is not intercepted, so no approval is raised by the r"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"untime; the request only appears when a tool call explicitly asks for a `sandbox_permissions` escala"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"tion or a pre-execute hook returns `ask` |\n| `desktop-popup.py` (macOS/Linux) | **never run on real "},{"id":"p30s9","text":"hardware** — syntax-checked only |\n| Popup process stacking after repeated `dsh web` restarts | the "},{"id":"p30s10","text":"launcher kills stale popups for its own port before starting a new one; verified for a single restar"},{"id":"p30s11","text":"kills stale popups for its own port before starting a new one; verified for a single restart cycle |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Use a spare port for popup experiments: the real popup on `7389` is left alone, because the plugin o"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"nly cleans up popup processes belonging to its own port."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Project structure"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Debug logs are written to:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- `~/.dsh/tn-plugin.log` — host plugin lifecycle, popup launcher, question watcher.\n- `~/.dsh/tn-lau"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ncher.log` — PID of the popup process created by the launcher.\n- `~/.dsh/tn-popup-debug.log` — popup"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" script lifecycle and polling errors."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"If the popup does not appear after restarting `dsh web`, check those logs first.\nNote that `popup la"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"uncher exit: code=0` in `tn-plugin.log` is expected: the plugin spawns a one-shot launcher which sta"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"rts the real popup process and then exits."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
